Privacy policy for My Sudoku
Last updated: [10/12/2026]

My Sudoku does not collect, store on any server, or share any personal data.

- The app has no user accounts, no advertising and no analytics.
- The app does not connect to the internet.
- Your game in progress and your settings are stored only on your device.
  Uninstalling the app deletes them.
- If you use "Import from image", the picture you choose or take is analysed
  on your device to read the puzzle. It is not saved by the app and is not
  sent anywhere. The camera is used only when you choose to take a photo.

